"Beyond the trees stood Willowbrook, a cluster of red roofs around a silver river. The market road was strangely empty. Across the water, wagons waited behind a rope. Someone was arguing with someone considerably larger.",
"Serena straightened her sword belt. She wanted to become a knight, and her Quest of Kindness still needed deeds worth doing. A troublesome bridge seemed promising. Lucas pointed out the nearly motionless mill wheel. Dribble sniffed the bakery smoke.",
"\"Adventure,\" declared Serena. \"Questions,\" said Lucas. \"Lunch,\" said Dribble. They were all looking at the same village."
};

